concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-320-2-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "320(4) 2  Importing psychoactive substances"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-320-2-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) In a prosecution for an offence under subsection (1), it is not necessary to prove that the defendant was reckless as to:  (a) the particular identity of the substance; or  (b) whether the substance had a particular psychoactive effect." ;
    skos:definition "(4) In a prosecution for an offence under subsection (1), it is not necessary to prove that the defendant was reckless as to:  (a) the particular identity of the substance; or  (b) whether the substance had a particular psychoactive effect."@en ;
