concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-205eb a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "205EB Extending the period for instituting proceedings for recovery"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-205eb ;
    values:originalText "of suspected prohibited psychoactive substances  (1) A person who has been given a notice under paragraph 205EA(2)(b) in relation to goods may, before the end of the applicable period under paragraph 205EA(4)(a), apply to a magistrate for an extension, or a further extension, of the period.  (2) If the magistrate is satisfied that:  (a) it is necessary that the retention of the goods continue while information is assembled relating to whether the goods are a prohibited psychoactive substance; and  (b) there has been no avoidable delay in assembling that information; the magistrate may order that the period be extended, or further extended, for a period specified in the order. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012  Psychoactive substances  Schedule 1  No. 12, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Psychoactive Substances and Other Measures) Act 2015" ;
    skos:definition "of suspected prohibited psychoactive substances  (1) A person who has been given a notice under paragraph 205EA(2)(b) in relation to goods may, before the end of the applicable period under paragraph 205EA(4)(a), apply to a magistrate for an extension, or a further extension, of the period.  (2) If the magistrate is satisfied that:  (a) it is necessary that the retention of the goods continue while information is assembled relating to whether the goods are a prohibited psychoactive substance; and  (b) there has been no avoidable delay in assembling that information; the magistrate may order that the period be extended, or further extended, for a period specified in the order. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012  Psychoactive substances  Schedule 1  No. 12, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Psychoactive Substances and Other Measures) Act 2015"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3a400e6c14d5c16dff16a73e55f43d5b578e4229a736cb166fc84e87f2643fc6" ;
    cof:pageNumber "16"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-205eb-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-1-sec-205eb-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
