doc:sch-1-sec-205ec-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "205EC(3) Proceedings for recovery of suspected prohibited" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) If:  (a) the goods to which proceedings of a kind referred to in paragraph 205EA(2)(b) relates have been disposed of or destroyed before the end of the proceedings; and  (b) the court hearing the proceedings decides that, apart from the disposal or destruction, it would have ordered that the goods be returned to a person; the court must order the Commonwealth to pay the person an amount equal to the market value of the goods at the time they were disposed of or destroyed." ;
    cof:pageNumber "17"^^xsd:integer .

