    skos:prefLabel "8 Subsection 360.2(3) of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-8 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: firearm part means either of the following within the meaning of the firearm law concerned:  (a) a firearm part; ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012  Schedule 2  Firearms trafficking offences  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Psychoactive Substances and Other Measures) Act 2015 No. 12, 2015  (b) a part of, or for, a firearm or weapon." ;
