    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-16-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) A person punished for an offence against a law of a State or Territory referred to in subsection (2) in respect of particular conduct cannot be punished for an offence against this Division in respect of that conduct." ;
