concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-2-sec-23 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "23 Subsection 233BAB(7)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-23 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (7) A person punished for an offence against subsection (5) or (6) in respect of particular conduct cannot be punished, in respect of that conduct, for an offence against:  (a) section 233; or  (b) Division 361 of the Criminal Code (about international firearms trafficking). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012  Schedule 2  Firearms trafficking offences  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Psychoactive Substances and Other Measures) Act 2015 No. 12, 2015  Note: A similar provision for the opposite case to paragraph (b) is set out in section 361.6 of the Criminal Code. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012  International transfer of prisoners  Schedule 3 Suspended sentences  Part 1  No. 12, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Psychoactive Substances and Other Measures) Act 2015" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (7) A person punished for an offence against subsection (5) or (6) in respect of particular conduct cannot be punished, in respect of that conduct, for an offence against:  (a) section 233; or  (b) Division 361 of the Criminal Code (about international firearms trafficking). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012  Schedule 2  Firearms trafficking offences  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Psychoactive Substances and Other Measures) Act 2015 No. 12, 2015  Note: A similar provision for the opposite case to paragraph (b) is set out in section 361.6 of the Criminal Code. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012  International transfer of prisoners  Schedule 3 Suspended sentences  Part 1  No. 12, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Psychoactive Substances and Other Measures) Act 2015"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "831bbf8307a2916bbbbaea6c728bac00dc300f34c50eb238d95db64a38ee010f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "25"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exempts punishment for certain conduct from other offences." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015.pdf> ;
