concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-4b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4B Suspended sentences of imprisonment"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-4b ;
    values:originalText "(1) Serving a sentence of imprisonment includes being subject to so much of the period of the sentence of imprisonment as involves a potential deprivation of liberty. Note: While a person is subject to a suspended sentence of imprisonment, he or she is treated under this Act as a prisoner serving that sentence of imprisonment.  (2) The suspended part of a sentence of imprisonment is so much of the period of the sentence of imprisonment as:  (a) involves a potential deprivation of liberty; and  (b) is not a period of release on parole." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Serving a sentence of imprisonment includes being subject to so much of the period of the sentence of imprisonment as involves a potential deprivation of liberty. Note: While a person is subject to a suspended sentence of imprisonment, he or she is treated under this Act as a prisoner serving that sentence of imprisonment.  (2) The suspended part of a sentence of imprisonment is so much of the period of the sentence of imprisonment as:  (a) involves a potential deprivation of liberty; and  (b) is not a period of release on parole."@en ;
