concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 After subsection 22(4)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (4A) If the prisoner is serving the suspended part of the sentence of imprisonment, the warrant is:  (a) to specify any conditions relating to that part of the sentence that have been imposed under an Australian law; and  (b) to specify any procedures for the transfer of the prisoner to the transfer country that have been agreed upon with the transfer country, and to give any necessary authorisations and directions. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012  International transfer of prisoners  Schedule 3 Suspended sentences  Part 1  No. 12, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Psychoactive Substances and Other Measures) Act 2015" ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (4A) If the prisoner is serving the suspended part of the sentence of imprisonment, the warrant is:  (a) to specify any conditions relating to that part of the sentence that have been imposed under an Australian law; and  (b) to specify any procedures for the transfer of the prisoner to the transfer country that have been agreed upon with the transfer country, and to give any necessary authorisations and directions. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012  International transfer of prisoners  Schedule 3 Suspended sentences  Part 1  No. 12, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Psychoactive Substances and Other Measures) Act 2015"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a73cfde0a0e1e330e16293c804e9dc5b2ca31dfcceba6cdb8330b241a503b1fb" ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Specifies conditions and procedures for prisoner transfer" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
