concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-12 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12 Subsection 30(4)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-12 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (4) However, if the prisoner:  (a) has been released on parole; or  (b) is serving the suspended part of the sentence of imprisonment; the warrant is to specify any procedures for the transfer of the prisoner to Australia that have been agreed upon with the transfer country and to give any necessary authorisations and directions." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute:  (4) However, if the prisoner:  (a) has been released on parole; or  (b) is serving the suspended part of the sentence of imprisonment; the warrant is to specify any procedures for the transfer of the prisoner to Australia that have been agreed upon with the transfer country and to give any necessary authorisations and directions."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6ea71d0135a61157a7a08acf70064e891be33c738ef12b069adf5d5b1c82f583" ;
    cof:pageNumber "29"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Specify procedures for prisoner transfer to Australia upon release or completion of suspended sentence." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
