concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-21 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21 Subsection 4(1) (definition of joint prisoner)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-21 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the definition, substitute: joint prisoner means:  (a) a prisoner who is serving sentences of imprisonment imposed under the laws of 2 or more of the States and Territories; or  (b) a federal prisoner who is also serving one or more sentences of imprisonment imposed under the laws of one or more of the States and Territories." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the definition, substitute: joint prisoner means:  (a) a prisoner who is serving sentences of imprisonment imposed under the laws of 2 or more of the States and Territories; or  (b) a federal prisoner who is also serving one or more sentences of imprisonment imposed under the laws of one or more of the States and Territories."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cf86e6356d4b38b1354a768ffeeea0f1a8efed1900458b149bdd7a828dbce66a" ;
