    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-32 ;
    values:originalText "Add: Note: The Attorney-General need not take any steps to decide the application if certain requirements are not met, or if it is less than 12 months since an earlier application for the prisoner was not proceeded with (see section 10A)." ;
