concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-18-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "18 Asking the transfer country to consent to the transfer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-18-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Attorney-General must ask the transfer country:  (a) whether it consents to the transfer of a prisoner for whom an application has been given under section 16; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012  Schedule 3  International transfer of prisoners" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Attorney-General must ask the transfer country:  (a) whether it consents to the transfer of a prisoner for whom an application has been given under section 16; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012  Schedule 3  International transfer of prisoners"@en ;
