doc:sch-3-sec-37 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "37 Section 24" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Omit “that country”, substitute “a transfer country”. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00012  International transfer of prisoners  Schedule 3 Other amendments  Part 3  No. 12, 2015 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Psychoactive Substances and Other Measures) Act 2015" ;
    cof:pageNumber "36"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-38 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "38 At the end of section 24"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-38 ;
    values:originalText "Add: Note: The Attorney-General need not take any steps to decide the request if certain requirements are not met, or if it is less than 12 months since an earlier request for the prisoner was not proceeded with (see section 10A).  (2) The request may be made by the transfer country, the prisoner or the prisoner’s representative." ;
    skos:definition "Add: Note: The Attorney-General need not take any steps to decide the request if certain requirements are not met, or if it is less than 12 months since an earlier request for the prisoner was not proceeded with (see section 10A).  (2) The request may be made by the transfer country, the prisoner or the prisoner’s representative."@en ;
