concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-28-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "28 Transfer country’s consent to transfer"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-28-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Attorney-General must, as soon as possible after the matters mentioned in subsection (2) are satisfied for a transfer, notify the transfer country of this and ask it:  (a) whether it consents to the transfer on the terms proposed in the notice; and  (b) to advise whether the prisoner, or the prisoner’s representative, consents to the transfer on those terms.  (2) The matters are as follows:  (a) paragraphs 10(a), (e) and (f);  (b) consent in writing, by any applicable State Ministers and Territory Ministers, has been given to transfer on those terms." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Attorney-General must, as soon as possible after the matters mentioned in subsection (2) are satisfied for a transfer, notify the transfer country of this and ask it:  (a) whether it consents to the transfer on the terms proposed in the notice; and  (b) to advise whether the prisoner, or the prisoner’s representative, consents to the transfer on those terms.  (2) The matters are as follows:  (a) paragraphs 10(a), (e) and (f);  (b) consent in writing, by any applicable State Ministers and Territory Ministers, has been given to transfer on those terms."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "eb8f90a40fbba3250b684446fcf35c7e2b46b63f3b4cceff9ad9ea439441b435" ;
    cof:pageNumber "37"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-28-2-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-psychoactive-substances-and-other-measures-act-2015-sch-3-sec-28-2-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
